{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615490/extras/ce7eadc5480219f14b436c5c45dbbd09.avif?t=1759869379\" width=560 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>On a spread of islands on the Pacific Ocean, you get yourself one, and you aim to be a farmer! It is a long way from home, but the corporate life is just not for you, not after what happened, not after all the years you lost in that life!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">However, you were only able to get an island in ruin, and you barely had enough cash to buy some seeds and see where you could take it from there! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Are you up to the challenge? let's find out! <br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615490/extras/44d9ebd959ca229f48e7b66f3b4f29ed.avif?t=1759869379\" width=560 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>34+ different plants &amp;\u00a0</i>trees </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>35+ main quests</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>Farm expansions</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>Seasons</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>Day-night cycle</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>Visit Friends Islands</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>Weather Effects</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>40+ Crafting recipes</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>10+ Buildings</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>5+ different animals</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>Full controller support</strong></i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>And so much more!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615490/extras/97ac6c2198b739a2a379a87e215d21a7.avif?t=1759869379\" width=560 height=128 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3615490?t=1759869379","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615490/546b440286623bb102164194b164398aa050bd06/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759869379","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615490/a3d9b86d413e88ef714b85a69ae3a66456c5b3e3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759869379","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615490/a3d9b86d413e88ef714b85a69ae3a66456c5b3e3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759869379","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Pl